Title: [Robot] Phase-aware Quiet Tracking Framework with Support-Transfer Correction (non-STD)
Cite 1: CN 122755662 A (Shenzhen Changying Robot, filed 2026.06.24, published 2026.09.15)
Cite 2: KR 10-0927572 B1 (Sign Telecom, filed 2007.02.28, registered 2009.11.12)
